{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act44side_level_act44side_08_beg",
  "groupId": "act44side",
  "stageId": "act44side_08",
  "title": "逝川",
  "storyCode": "AT-8",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act44side/level_act44side_08_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cc6b0daf74f61c15aedfc0029c9db3b4c90a149b50a01a60ba408d412faa17b5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g14_mifuneoffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对，是我！我刚从议员大人那里回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊现在在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "会场？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "澪呢？澪控制住他们了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有？！她自己离开了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叛徒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "线路呢？里面的事录下来了吗？星熊的状态怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......该死！赶快让后期处理一下，把她和澪对打的场景处理成她已经彻底疯狂的证据——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么叫来不及？！忍客入侵？！线路劫持？！处理不了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......废物！处理不了就赶快切断信号传输，还有供电系统！今晚已经只剩道歉声明要播了，信号掐了又能怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "关键是决不能让人在我的电视台不受控制地胡说八道——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂？喂？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*东国粗口*，断线了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死的议员，什么“要你当面解释”，我去解释，不就是给敌人乘虚而入的机会吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这下好了，我跟他说废话的时候，一切都乱了套，连般若都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（深呼吸）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冷静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不就是收拾残局从头再来嘛，没事，这又不是第一次了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先去会场阻止那群混蛋，星熊的事，议员已经点了头，只要能在舆论上处理干净......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，跟你的星熊姐一起来捣乱了，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天啊，我该说你勇气可嘉呢，还是傻得可爱呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看你这一身伤。看来我的手下还不知道你已经没用了，还在陪你过家家呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你手里的真刀是从哪位大哥手里抢来的？告诉我，我把它还回去，不然人家会生气的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金兵卫......你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我现在没时间陪你玩，哲也君。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你父亲从小教你的那几下刀法，作为基础固然不错，但要用它上阵杀敌，你还差得远，差得太远。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟是一对能被面具挑拨了关系的父子，他教你的刀法，你又能领会几分？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "挑拨？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "挑拨，是啊......挑拨......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该说的我都说完了。现在就给我滚，不然，我也不介意再把主意改回来，直接送你去见铁斋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该滚去见我父亲的人......是你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位观众......晚上......好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里是羽生、羽生......萌萌香。害怕怪谈，却又被怪谈缠身的羽生萌萌香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常抱歉，在刚刚发生过那么大的放送事故之后，再来打扰大家......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g2_jindastreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊讶的粉丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1911_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌亲？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的粉丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1911_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌亲不是失踪了吗，怎么突然又冒出来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惊讶的粉丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1909_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道刚才的警报真的是怪谈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疑惑的粉丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1911_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那现在是......她正在怪谈中......向我们所有人求助？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，如各位所见，我又站在这里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种荒诞的事在我身上发生好像特别正常。怪谈嘛，就该是这样的。一会儿冒出来，一会儿又消失了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可......如果我告诉大家，根本就没有什么怪谈呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g2_jindastreet_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尖酸的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香？玩失踪不说，还搅得满城风雨，为了捧她金石台可真是下了血本。这次又有什么怪谈给她蹭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游荡的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......她说怪谈是假的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尖酸的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？她疯了？怎么可能？她当我们都是傻子？怪谈不是每时每刻都在发生吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "游荡的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_033",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她自己说的，你要看就看，别问我啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我告诉大家，除了极少数几个怪谈跟神明有关之外，我做过的所有节目，经历过的所有的怪谈......都是编造出来的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不是假设。这是真实的谎言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金石电视台和演艺事务所欺骗了大家。而我，尽管一直被蒙在鼓里，也成了欺骗各位的帮凶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对于欺骗大家一事，我没有任何借口，接受大家全部的指责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g15_higashiroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "生气的母亲",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_759_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是和你说了今晚不要看电视吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雀跃的孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_762_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同学说上面在播很厉害的东西啊！你看！怪谈明星亲自说怪谈是假的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我参与的谎言......不计其数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就比如，一连串怪谈的源头，位于锻冶町的“金石会青鬼”的旧居，连续让居住者死去的凶宅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那不是怪谈。那是真真切切的杀人案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在此指控三船光平，金石台和演艺事务所的所有者，黑道组织金石会的实际控制人，是幕后真凶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他无端疑心我与他的对头铁斋勾结，在我对自己身处的环境一无所知时，就已经在策划让我感染矿石病了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所谓“金石会的青鬼”，正是多年前代他受过离开御机的人，她救了我，却反而被诬陷为“劫持”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而后，我无意中触及了所谓怪谈背后隐藏的真相，他就要杀人灭口，还制造我要隐退的谣言......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g13_smallroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "值班警察",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1914_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "惟任先生！上面已经快气疯了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "值班警察",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1914_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这已经是第八道让我们截断直播信号的命令了，您看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前七道我们怎么应对的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "值班警察",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1914_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没应对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那不就得了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你们一直念叨我什么。“会好的”“会好的”，说到后来，连我自己都没底气了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "惟任刑警",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1898_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎么说，今晚有我顶着，就让警察好上这么一个晚上，不必看任何人的脸色，也算我给你们一份临别赠礼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g12_stage"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......以上，就是我今晚不得不告诉大家的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来，我还想说一些题外话，一些......关于我自己的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，很多人都觉得我在节目中害怕的表现很激烈，甚至有点......做作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我希望告诉大家的是，恐惧这个词，几乎贯穿了羽生萌萌香迄今为止的人生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里固然有小时候长辈给我讲了太多恐怖故事的缘故，但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更深的原因是，我的家乡在后川城，以水污染闻名的后川城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里的恐惧从来都不是半夜在街上游荡的杀人鬼，不是会带来不幸的独轮车，不是会伪装成电梯等人进去的“地狱”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐惧是某一天忽然卧床不起的亲戚，是走路时莫名其妙地摔跤，是好像有些不适，却不敢确定是否真的开始发麻的双手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一切只会自然而然地发生，当你意识到的时候已经......晚了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我实在太幸运了。我来到了御机，沐浴在喜爱我的、审视我的、厌恶我的目光之下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的恐惧不再是病痛和死亡，而是观众的评判，粉丝的流失，事务所的压力，还有子虚乌有的怪谈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在生命重新受到威胁的现在，转过头来想想，能为这些而恐惧......多奢侈啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能为怪谈害怕，其实是一种......幸福，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们不用去面对真实的危险，只需要躺在床上，为一个不知真假的故事惊声尖叫，然后在神经从紧绷到放松的过程中彻底满足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我......今后的我，恐怕没法再享受这样的乐趣了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当我知道，从来都只是吓我一跳的怪谈背后其实是欺骗，是贪婪，是杀人灭口，我再也没法用那种奢侈的心态去面对它们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，从今往后，羽生萌萌香不再是怪谈缠身的艺人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从今往后，羽生萌萌香与金石会下属的演艺事务所，脱离一切关系！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g14_mifuneoffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三船脚边，躺在地上的哲也已经遍体鳞伤。\n并不是斐迪亚有意要留他一命。\n事实上，他无数次想快些了结对方，疯狂的鬼却总是如同不要命一般冲向他的刀尖，只为了能在被刺穿后也刺穿对方。\n一旁的屏幕中，萌萌香的言辞一句一句地灌入他的耳朵，更让他双手颤抖，连连失准。\n他的意图从一击毙命变成重伤失能，又变成赶紧摆脱这个发疯的祸害，快些收拾乱局，但哲也总能在身上多添一道伤口之后爬起来......\n而萌萌香的宣言，也已经到了尾声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "演艺的路我还会走下去，无论如何，只要我还活着，就会走下去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要做的是给人带来希望，是让困境中的人，让被恐惧缠身的人知道，有人曾经和你们一样，有人能和你们感同身受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人会把你们的故事唱出来，演出来，有人会拼尽全力，让你们的声音不至于悄无声息地消失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萌萌香的额头上滑过一滴汗珠，她轻轻用手将其拂去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是说了好了不得的话啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知为什么，说了大话之后，我突然有点害怕了。我胆子小嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我刚刚在想，也许我们的生活中不止怪谈这一种谎言，也许这样的谎言数不胜数，也许我们繁荣的生活......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......就建立在这些谎言之上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个不知轻重的疯女人到底在说什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她知不知道一切都建立在信心之上，她知不知道，假如有人信以为真，假如这样的恐慌扩散开去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但这......就是我们的生活。在那个也许永远不会到来的尾声到来之前，一直持续下去的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕真的建立在谎言......不，泡泡之上，哪怕泡泡明天就要破掉，这也是我们的生活......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不得不去喜欢的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更何况，这样的生活就算总有一天会消失，但它......很美，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕是一瞬间的美，只要深深印在心中，在破灭的那一天到来之后，它也会成为夜里的一点难得的温暖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要说的......就这么多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉占用了大家宝贵的时间。我是羽生萌萌香。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许......不，我相信，我们很快就会再见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "已经没有翻盘的余地了。\n斐迪亚呆在原地，只是木然地看着屏幕上那个人的身影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g14_mifuneoffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，你又站起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们再来一次吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "碍事的女人终于讲完一长串疯话，现在你可以再试试来替你爹报仇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年轻的鬼摇摇晃晃地摆出架势，而终于冷静下来的斐迪亚已经看准了他肋间的破绽，只等他动手，就一击取走他的性命。\n但鬼迟迟没有出手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怕了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是连我这样的傻瓜都明白，你已经死了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哲也转过身去，而三船尽管脸色铁青，却也没了下一步的动作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哲也",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1899_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的后背亮给你了。不杀我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突然没心情了。我还有不少要杀的人排在你前面呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等他们全都死光，我会去找你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，还有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三船盯着哲也的背影，忽然冒出一句连他自己也不清楚为什么要讲的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......早些时候我对你父亲讲的那些话，其实是讲给你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而哲也分不清三船到底是挑衅还是有什么别的意图，最终只是回过头，用充血的眼睛剜了三船一眼，然后踉踉跄跄地离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一切如同梦境般不真实。\n说完那一长串告白后，自己因为过度激动扑通一声倒在了舞台上。\n然后的事情就有些模糊......但无论如何，星熊朝楼上走去，而森内、吉星和更纱带着自己往楼下走。\n中间似乎还有打斗，有爆炸，但那些事情好像都发生在很遥远很遥远的地方——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g17_jindaalley_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是哪里？吉星？森内老板？更纱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更纱怎么倒在地上......睡了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，刚才在电视台里的时候她好像也睡过一次......难道她是很容易累倒的那种体质？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行，现在得我背着她跑了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香，你在哪？更纱呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吉星的声音",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们到底走到哪条巷子里去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜呜呜！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，可算抓住你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈、哈哈，居然独自把这女人抓住了，这可是大功一件......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多亏身上带了胶带，不然这女人是唱歌的，号起来我可受不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没入行的时候我还憧憬什么“忍术道具”，结果，唉，我这样的人，能拿到的都是些破烂玩意儿，高端的都在前辈手里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得赶快向上面报告——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，我都忘了，终端的电被我故意放空了，原本想在后巷的小咖啡馆里躲一下午清闲的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没想到最后居然手到擒来抓住了这女人，我这运气也是没谁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“源石电路兵粮丸”呢？我找找......有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "忍者把“源石电路兵粮丸”——一个球形的源石电器，上面支出一根长长的线——接在自己黑屏的终端上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这电充得真慢啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，我把你嘴上的胶布扯下来，你帮我唱两句怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸噫噫啊欸嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算你答应，我也不会松开的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "知道吗，那天晚上你骑着摩托车跑了之后，一直是我们这些人在到处追你。你的家就是本大爷搜的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噫唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你家也真是寒酸得要命，我还以为像你这样的大偶像不得住个豪宅什么的，结果什么油水都没得捞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，你窗边摆的那一排东西又是什么？该不会是什么奇怪的恋物癖吧，哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呜呜呜——噗啊！咳、咳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你再说一遍？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "胶带开了？我绑的手法应该没问题啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，管那么多呢，一个弱不禁风的偶像罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉你，我不光把你窗边上的怪东西挨个检查了一遍，那棵离死不远的植物，我也帮你剪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叶助是你剪断的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“叶助”？哦，那棵还没有杂草高的树苗啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我啊，怎么了？也不知道你怎么照顾的，那破草根本没有活路，叶子都黄得发脆了，我才大发善心帮你把它剪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也养过花的。养花这种事要有耐心，最重要的是，要有无微不至的关怀和爱，懂吗？就你这样的人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎、怎么回事，怎么站起来了？这胶带也太劣质了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对的，你肯定是会点儿什么源石技艺。你既然是阿戈尔......和水相关的那种？对对对，就是这么回事。怪不得胶带开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不对，前辈是不是说过，除了感染者以外，没人能徒手用源石技艺？但这就说不通了。你总不能是靠蛮力扯断的吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不不，你一副弱不禁风的样子，怎么可能徒手撕开我亲手绑好的胶带呢。肯定是源石技艺。肯定是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你也就这样了。你下一步打算做什么？把水滋到我脸上？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "尽管嘴上不停挑衅，但刚入行的忍者仍然紧紧盯着萌萌香的眼睛。\n困兽犹斗，这个女人也不例外。她会用什么样的源石技艺和自己拼命？雾气？高压水流？或许......酸液？\n不能放松警惕。不能因为眼前的女人是个毫无战斗经验的偶像就掉以轻心。\n她的法术多半不怎么强，她施术时，施术单元的反应也一定很轻微。与其盯着杖尖——虽然那东西长得像麦克风——不如紧盯眼睛。\n眼睛会出卖她心里所想的一切。\n例如......杀意。\n呵，真是个不知轻重的女人。\n但她也就到此为止了。应该再看看，她眼里还有什么信息泄露出来。也许是方位，或是施术的时机，还是......\n怎么除了杀意就没别的了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这个念头还没转过去，忍者头顶突然“当”的一声闷响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1916_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用麦克风敲头......算什么法术？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凶手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "畜生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有人心的恶魔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是我的叶助！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你、你冷——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不冷静！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它明明还没死，你怎么能就因为手贱，就把我的叶助给——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剪了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "和刚刚在台上凛然绽放的姿态截然相反，萌萌香语无伦次地倾吐着恨意......\n而她手里的麦克风，一次，又一次，带着无匹的愤怒，狠狠地敲在忍者身上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刚入行的忍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别、别打了，别——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萌萌香",
      "speakerId": "avg_4202_haruka_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要打！我打死你这个没人性的东西！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ibindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "震惊的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萌萌香？你在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴怒的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在打这个混蛋！就是他剪了我的叶助！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "震惊的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，呃，你......没事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴怒的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没事！我很好！我今晚要把这个害死了叶助的混球打成肉酱！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "震惊的声音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，那个，萌萌香，消消气，消消气......撤退要紧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雨点般的殴打终于停了下来，两个人的脚步声渐渐远去。\n那个震惊的声音，是和萌萌香一起的那个吉星吧。对的，是吉星把萌萌香领走了，一定是这样的。\n谢谢你，吉星。你真是个人如其名的好人——\n这是刚入行不久的忍者在失去意识之前没能说出口的，最真挚的谢意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "64_g14_mifuneoffice"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我等你很久了。这么多年过去，还是没人拦得住你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......别装腔作势了。你手下的人早就一哄而散，我到这里来，没有遇到任何阻碍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在我大势已去，不知道金石会的青鬼亲自登门拜访，究竟所为何事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你是来替自己、替铁斋寻仇，就在这里拔刀吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "星熊摇了摇头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的罪行已经全数暴露在你最拿手的电视上。不管你上面那位“议员大人”到底收了你多少好处，都不会再来保你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些勾兑、隐瞒、来回输送的利益，也许议员会拼命掩盖，但我不关心这些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能确定的是，你实打实杀死的人，他们的冤屈终将昭雪，这就足够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你说话的口气活像个条子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错，我的确在龙门当警察。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我挺想笑的。可惜，今晚不太能笑得出来。我之前还真以为“龙门近卫局”只是个用来当噱头的名字呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只不过是来完成二十年前那一步踏出之后就该完成的事情。我来斩断跟东国的最后一点因缘。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "斩？怎么斩？过去发生的一切都不会被你斩断，宿业和因缘会永远缠着你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕你已经将那些东西缠上一圈又一圈锁链，封进一个又一个箱子，它也会在你最不经意的时刻跳出来，将一切撕得粉碎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能斩的不过是我的喉咙，就算斩了，那也只是个形式罢了，说到底，不还是泄愤吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......对，形式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我对你，对御机，已经没有任何奢求，我只需要一个形式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "写一份绝缘书吧，昭告整个御机，星熊和御机，和金石会，和所谓的青鬼的怪谈，从此再无关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "高大的斐迪亚怔了怔，随即神经质地笑了起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "龙门真是把你从骨子里变成了个条子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过我拒绝。要让一个人被组织除名，我们有更好的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来跟我刀剑相向，来悖逆我这个所谓的会长。不论我们中的哪个倒下，金石会都不再会有一点余地，承认你是其中一员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你非要这么做吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这才是完成二十年前未完成的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "三船环视自己的办公室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我多少有点喜欢这里，打坏了未免可惜。我们换个地方动手吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锻冶町。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里已经被你夷平了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算被夷平了，那里也是承载着你我回忆的地方，不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_1044_hsgma2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......恶趣味。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "三船",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1896_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧。去得早些，说不定花火大会还能剩下个尾巴呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
